{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30132","headline":"病中晨起即事寄场中往还 · 刘得仁","name":"病中晨起即事寄场中往还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日离尘里，今朝懒已成。\n岂能爲久隐，更欲泥浮名。\n虚牖晨光白，幽园晓气清。\n戴沙寻水去，披雾入林行。\n叠叶孤禽在，初阳半树明。\n桑麻新雨润，芦荻古波声。\n易向田家熟，元于世路生。\n病多三径塞，吟苦四邻惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}